    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. ReIgister now at SherryFitz.ie\nThis attractive, detached bungalow residence is located on the Sleaty Road, immediately opposite the Barrow Valley Retail Park (Dunnes Stores) entrance. Constructed in 1975, the bungalow was originally configured as a 3-bedroom dwelling with an integrated garage arrangement, this later converted to an additional reception room. The entire now extends to 137 sq m, with a generously proportioned layout, while a large attic cavity presents immediate capacity for extension if required. The entire will benefit from a fixture and decorative upgrade but offers massive scope. \nThe site enjoys a vehicular entrance from the main road to a tarmac surrounding yard, while surrounding mature garden areas preserve privacy. Mains services are available, with an oil-fired central heating system delivers space heating, complimented by a solid fuel stove in the sitting room.\nThe residential site extends to 0.37 acres, while a further land allocation to its rear offers an additional 1.7 acres, currently set in pasture, the entire in the region of 2 acres.\nViewings are highly recommended and invited on a strictly appointment basis."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - \nAluminium glazed door and side glazing panels to front.Stone carpet flooring. Teak glass panelled hall door.\n\nEntrance Hall - 3.64m x 2.17m and 5.45m x 1.02m\nL-shaped hall. Cloak press and Hot Press off. Pine panelled ceolings. Carpets. Attic access hatch.\n\nSitting Room - 4.85m x 4.20m\nLarge window to front. Curtains and pole.Carpets. Coving. Solid fuel fireplace with stove. Shelving.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.17m x 3.68m\nWindow and sliding patio doors to rear. Ceramic tiled floor. Fitted floor and wall units. Utility room off.\n\nUtility Room - 2.16m x 1.74m\nTeak glass panelled door to rear. Ceramic tiled floor. Plumbing for utility machines. Oil boiler. W.C. off.\n\nW.C. - 2.19m x 1.22m\nWindow to rear. Toilet and sink. Ceramic tiled floor.\n\nFamily Room - 5.56m x 3.02m\nSliding patio doors to front and side. Ceramic tiled floor. Pine panelled ceiling.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.66m x 3.07m\nDouble room, window to rear. Curtains and pole. Timber floor. Sliding wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.67m x 3.66m\nDouble room, window to rear. Carpets\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.12m x 3.52m\nDouble room, window to front. Timber floor. Sliding wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.94m x 2.47m\nWindow to front. Ceramic tiled floor and walls. Full wet-room shower arrangement, toilet and sink.\n\n"
      },
